---
import EuropeMap from '../diagrams/EuropeMap.astro';
import SourceMarker from '../SourceMarker.astro';
---
<section class="section europe" id="europe" aria-labelledby="europe-title">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>07 · <span class="eyebrow__rest">FROM LUXEMBOURG, INTO EUROPE</span></p>
    <div class="section-head europe__head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="europe-title" data-reveal style="--i:1">Luxembourg is the base. Europe is the market.</h2>
      <p class="lead" data-reveal style="--i:2">We work from Luxembourg into the customers, partners, institutions and capital that fit the opportunity. We pick the first market on five tests: buyer need, access, economics, regulation and speed to evidence. Then we expand from what works.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-12 europe__body" data-scene="europe">
      <figure class="europe__map">
        <EuropeMap layout="wide" />
        <EuropeMap layout="compact" />
        <figcaption class="caption europe__caption">Luxembourg is our operating base: international, cross-border and inside the EU. The market comes from the opportunity, not the map.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="europe__side">
        <h3 class="h3 europe__side-title" data-reveal>What the base gives you.</h3>
        <ul class="europe__figures">
          <li class="fig" style="--i:0">
            <p class="fig__num"><span>EU</span></p>
            <p class="fig__text">Inside the single market: EU law and regulation, with the European Investment Bank in Luxembourg.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="fig" style="--i:1">
            <p class="fig__num"><span>€6.79tn</span><SourceMarker n={3} /></p>
            <p class="fig__text">Net assets of investment funds based in Luxembourg.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="fig" style="--i:2">
            <p class="fig__num"><span>45%</span><SourceMarker n={4} /></p>
            <p class="fig__text">of people working in Luxembourg live in France, Germany or Belgium. Cross-border is the default.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="fig" style="--i:3">
            <p class="fig__num"><span>€300m</span><SourceMarker n={5} /></p>
            <p class="fig__text">Extra SNCI financing over five years for start-ups and innovation, through loans, aid and equity.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .europe__head {
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .europe__body {
    margin-top: var(--s-8);
    row-gap: var(--s-7);
  }
  .europe__map {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .map {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .map--wide {
    display: none;
  }
  .map--compact {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .europe__caption {
    margin-top: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .europe__figures {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--s-6) var(--s-4);
    align-content: start;
  }
  .fig {
    padding-top: var(--s-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-700);
  }
  .fig__num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 21.33px + 1.296vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--text-100);
  }
  .fig__num .src {
    top: 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .fig__text {
    margin-top: var(--s-3);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-300);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .map--wide {
      display: block;
      max-width: 720px;
    }
    .map--compact {
      display: none;
    }
    .europe__figures {
      gap: var(--s-6) var(--gutter);
    }
    .fig__text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
  .europe__side-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .europe__map {
      grid-column: 1 / span 7;
    }
    .europe__side {
      grid-column: 8 / span 5;
      margin-left: var(--s-5);
    }
    .europe__figures {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Map styles */
  .map__outline {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--line-700);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .map__arc {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--teal-300);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .map__arc--out {
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    stroke: var(--teal-300);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .map__mask-path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 8;
  }
  .map__end-dot {
    fill: var(--teal-300);
  }
  .map__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--fs);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    fill: var(--text-300);
    /* Dark halo keeps labels legible where arcs pass behind them */
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: var(--ink-950);
    stroke-width: 4px;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .map__label--muted {
    fill: var(--text-500);
  }
  .map__label--hub {
    fill: var(--copper-400);
  }
  .map__hub-dot {
    fill: var(--copper-400);
  }
  .map__pulse {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--copper-400);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    opacity: 0;
    transform-box: fill-box;
    transform-origin: center;
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-visible .map__pulse {
    animation: hub-pulse 2.4s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes hub-pulse {
    0% {
      opacity: 0.8;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(3.4);
    }
  }

  /* Sequence: hub, arcs (200ms stagger), 600ms pause, outbound dashed arcs; figures reveal as arcs land */
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__hub {
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__arc:not(.map__arc--out),
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__mask-path {
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset var(--dur-slow) var(--ease-in-out);
    transition-delay: calc(400ms + var(--i) * 200ms);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__mask-path {
    transition-delay: calc(2700ms + var(--i) * 200ms);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__end,
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__out-label {
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
    transition-delay: calc(1250ms + var(--i) * 200ms);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .map__out-label {
    transition-delay: calc(3550ms + var(--i) * 200ms);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'] .fig {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition:
      opacity var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
      transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
    transition-delay: calc(1300ms + var(--i) * 200ms);
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .map__hub,
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .map__end,
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .map__out-label,
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .fig {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .map__arc,
  .js.motion [data-scene='europe'].is-play .map__mask-path {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
  }
</style>
